OL,3,ANigerian university in mourning after
OL,4,Afour students die at post-exam party
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour Nigerian students have died after
OL,7,Fattending a party in the south-eastern
OL,8,Ftown of Nsukka to celebrate the end of
OL,9,Ftheir final exams.
OL,11,FThe cause of death has not been
OL,12,Fconfirmed but police spokesman Daniel
OL,13,FNdukwe said the two men and two women
OL,14,Fhad reportedly fallen ill after
OL,15,Fconsuming alcoholic drinks at the
OL,16,Fparty.
OL,18,FThe University of Nigeria Nsukka has
OL,19,Fdeclared three days of mourning, during
OL,20,Fwhich academic and social activities
OL,21,Fwill be suspended.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
